# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Binary keyword costs publish their Forge-formatted title.
# Forcing: Four Mountains fund Coruscation Mage and its optional offspring cost.
# AI behavior: Empty hand leaves the cast and token trigger uncontested.
# Protocol path: Cast, AdditionalCost, keyword payment, creature resolution and token trigger.
# Failure modes: Generic label, missing cost, payment mismatch or missing token.
# Card roles: Coruscation Mage offers offspring; Mountains pay; Island holds priority; Ornithopter is an unchanged control.
